{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7bec4686-3b08-82d2-9ba0-3fb4503f2c58",
  "created_at": "2026-01-18T14:01:39-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marco DeLuca",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:58:56-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:59:00-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Denise. Marco DeLuca. [pause] I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, so I figured this was the line to try."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:59:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got the right one. We pick up here on weekends. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:59:17-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, there's a fire hydrant that's buried. We got that dusting overnight, and with the cold snap it's all frozen up around the base. Plow came through and pushed a ridge of it right over the top."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:59:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, yeah, that'll happen. Is it a big pile or just a crust?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:59:39-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Crust on top of a pile. Maybe knee high, packed hard. [pause] You can barely see the cap on it, it's just a little red nub."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:59:51-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Do you have a street for me? Or a cross street, whatever's easiest."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T13:59:58-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, hang on. Sorry, the other call I was on had that hold music, and it's still stuck in my head. Drives me nuts. [pause] Okay. It's on Admiral Kalbfus Road, near the corner with Valley Road. Hydrant's on the right if you're heading toward the water."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:00:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Admiral Kalbfus near Valley, right side heading toward the water. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:00:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. I manage a building near there, so I walk past it every day. I just want it logged so somebody knows it's there. I'm not asking for it to get done this minute."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's fair, I'll put it in the log right now. Buried hydrant, packed snow about knee high. It'll go on the list for the crews to clear."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:00:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. [line breaks up] Sorry, you cut out. Did you say it goes on the list?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:01-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, it goes on the list. Hydrants get priority over a lot of the other cleanup, so it should move up pretty quick."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That's all I needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a callback number on the entry, in case somebody needs to confirm the spot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:23-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0165."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:25-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0165. Got it, Mr. DeLuca."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks, Denise. I appreciate you picking up on a Sunday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anytime. Stay warm out there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-18T14:01:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
